  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to assist displaced persons through monitoring displacement dynamics and emergency response to needs generated by conflicts and disastersin the Central African Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Central African Republic (CAR) has been facing a persistent humanitarian crisis for several years, the harmful consequences of which are severely affecting the population. As part of this project, IOM is planning an appropriate, coordinated, and effective humanitarian response to the urgent needs of populations affected by new shocks in CAR. This project is based on two pillars: a rapid emergency response to crises, and the provision of critical, up-to-date information on displacement dynamics and the needs they generate.</narrative>
  </description>
